{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21762","headline":"乐府古题序 当来日大难行 · 元稹","name":"乐府古题序 当来日大难行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"当来日大难行，前有阪，後有坑。\n大梁侧，小梁倾。\n两轴相绞，两轮相撑。\n大牛竖，小牛横。\n乌啄牛背，足趺力儜，当来日大难行。\n太行虽险，险可使平。\n轮轴自挠，牵制不停。\n泥潦渐久，荆棘旋生。\n行必不得，不如不行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21762.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21762","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}